data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"content\": \"# Design: Hello Campaign Greeting App\\n\\n## Overview\\n\\nA single-page React + Vite application that greets the viewer and lets them change the greeting's colour by clicking one of four buttons.\\n\\n## Layout\\n\\nThe page is wrapped in the `@codesweep-ai/ui` `AppShell`, which supplies the global chrome:\\n\\n- **Header**: sticky dark bar at the top. Title reads **\\\"Hello\\\"** on the left. No navigation items, no actions.\\n- **Footer**: dark bar at the bottom. Centered text reads **\\\"Built with @codesweep-ai/ui\\\"**.\\n- **Main content area**: sits between Header and Footer, fills the remaining viewport height, and centers its content both vertically and horizontally.\\n\\nInside the main content area:\\n\\n- A single large greeting line, centered.\\n- Below it, a horizontal row of four colour buttons, centered, with equal spacing between them.\\n\\n## Greeting\\n\\nThe greeting text is:\\n\\n\u003e **Hello, world!**\\n\\nRendered in a large, bold type size. The default colour on first load is **teal** (`--color-cat-2`).\\n\\n## Colour buttons\\n\\nFour `Button` components from `@codesweep-ai/ui`, arranged left to right, each labelled with its colour name:\\n\\n| Label | Token applied to greeting | Button variant |\\n|-------|---------------------------|----------------|\\n| Teal  | `--color-cat-2`           | `secondary`    |\\n| Amber | `--color-cat-3`           | `warning`      |\\n| Rose  | `--color-cat-4`           | `danger`       |\\n| Sky   | `--color-cat-9`           | `primary`      |\\n\\nClicking a button immediately changes the greeting text colour to the corresponding token. The colour must be applied via the CSS custom property (e.g. `style={{ color: 'var(--color-cat-2)' }}`), not by resolving the hex value in JavaScript.\\n\\n## Design system usage\\n\\nThe following come from `@codesweep-ai/ui`:\\n\\n- `AppShell`, `Header`, `Footer` — layout chrome.\\n- `Button` — the four colour-change buttons.\\n- `--color-cat-2`, `--color-cat-3`, `--color-cat-4`, `--color-cat-9` — greeting colours.\\n\\nImport the design-system styles in the entry file:\\n\\n```js\\nimport \\\"@codesweep-ai/ui/styles/core.css\\\";\\nimport \\\"@codesweep-ai/ui/styles/components/app-shell.css\\\";\\nimport \\\"@codesweep-ai/ui/styles/components/button.css\\\";\\n```\\n\\nNo additional components from the catalog are required.\\n\\n## State\\n\\nHold the active greeting colour token string with React `useState`, initialised to `\\\"var(--color-cat-2)\\\"`. Each button's `onClick` updates that state to its own token.\\n\\n## Server\\n\\nBind the Vite development server to `0.0.0.0` on port `5173` so the host can forward the page.\\n\\n## Deliverables\\n\\n- `package.json` with `@codesweep-ai/ui` as a dependency and scripts for building and serving.\\n- `vite.config.js` bound to `0.0.0.0:5173`.\\n- `README.md` documenting the build and serve commands.\\n- `.gitignore` ignoring `node_modules/` and `dist/`.\\n- Source files (`index.html`, `src/main.jsx`, `src/App.jsx`, etc.) implementing the design above.\\n\", \"filePath\": \"/home/<USER:1>/hello-app/DESIGN.md\"}","name":"write"},"id":"write_25","index":0,"type":"function"}]},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789849013,"id":"chatcmpl-3fe08c6332734ab6bc01d344de87fbea","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

